title: "Upload2Shell: CVE-2026-125396 zero-click RCE chain (Debian 13, Ubuntu 22.04/24.04)"
abstract: "A zero-click exploitation chain for CVE-2026-125396: anonymous IPP Print-Job to a shared CUPS queue, gstopdf/gstoraster, Ghostscript -dSAFER Type 1 font use-after-free, native path-control bypass, and command execution as the filter account."
